    "continuationCount": 0,
    "content": "<h2>Hollow Snowpriest</h2>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><em>Medium Aberration (Humanoid), Chaotic Evil</em><br>___<br><strong>Armor Class</strong> :: 14 (Tainted Armour)<br><strong>Hit Points</strong>  :: 108 (24d8+0)<br><strong>Speed</strong>       :: 45ft.<br>___</p>\n<div class=\"ak5e-source-table-wrap\"><table class=\"ak5e-source-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">STR</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">DEX</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CON</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">INT</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">WIS</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CHA</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10 (0)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">14 (+2)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">12 (+1)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">8 (-1)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">14 (+2)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">3  (-4)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">___<br><strong>Saving Throws</strong>        :: Dexterity +4, Wisdom +4<br><strong>Condition Immunities</strong> :: Charmed, Frightened<br><strong>Senses</strong>               :: passive Perception 12<br><strong>Languages</strong>            :: Understands the languages it spoke before, but cannot speak<br><strong>Challenge</strong>            :: 3 (700 XP) <strong>Proficiency Bonus</strong> +2<br>---<br><strong><em>Arts Resistance.</em></strong> This Creature has Advantage on Saving Throws against Arts and Art-like Abilities.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Brainbreakers.</em></strong> Whenever you would take a Reaction against something this Creature has done, you must first succeed on a DC13 Intelligence Saving Throw. If the Saving Throw is failed, that Reaction is not performed, but your Reaction is not consumed.</p>\n<h3>Actions</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Arts Staff.</em></strong> <em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +3 to hit, reach 5ft., one target. <em>Hit:</em> 4 (1d6) Bludgeoning Damage</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Chaining Frost Shock (Art).</em></strong> <em>Ranged Spell Attack:</em> +4 to hit, range 60 ft., up to three targets within 10 feet of each other, <em>Hit:</em> 7 (1d8+2) Cold Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Spellcasting.</em></strong> This Creature casts one of the following Arts, using Wisdom as its Spellcasting Ability (Spell Save DC 12):</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><em>At Will:</em> Armour of Agathys, Rime's Binding Ice</p>\n<h3>Bonus Actions</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Snowpriest (Recharge 5+):</em></strong> This Creature casts an \"At Will\" Art that has a cost of Action as a Bonus Action.</p>",
    "rawSource": "## Hollow Snowpriest\n*Medium Aberration (Humanoid), Chaotic Evil*\n___\n**Armor Class** :: 14 (Tainted Armour)\n**Hit Points**  :: 108 (24d8+0)\n**Speed**       :: 45ft.\n___\n|  STR  |  DEX  |  CON  |  INT  |  WIS  |  CHA  |\n|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|\n|10 (0) |14 (+2)|12 (+1)|8 (-1) |14 (+2)|3  (-4)|\n___\n**Saving Throws**        :: Dexterity +4, Wisdom +4\n**Condition Immunities** :: Charmed, Frightened\n**Senses**               :: passive Perception 12\n**Languages**            :: Understands the languages it spoke before, but cannot speak\n**Challenge**            :: 3 (700 XP) {{bonus **Proficiency Bonus** +2}}\n---\n***Arts Resistance.*** This Creature has Advantage on Saving Throws against Arts and Art-like Abilities.\n:\n***Brainbreakers.*** Whenever you would take a Reaction against something this Creature has done, you must first succeed on a DC13 Intelligence Saving Throw. If the Saving Throw is failed, that Reaction is not performed, but your Reaction is not consumed.\n:\n### Actions\n***Arts Staff.*** *Melee Weapon Attack:* +3 to hit, reach 5ft., one target. *Hit:* 4 (1d6) Bludgeoning Damage\n:\n***Chaining Frost Shock (Art).*** *Ranged Spell Attack:* +4 to hit, range 60 ft., up to three targets within 10 feet of each other, *Hit:* 7 (1d8+2) Cold Damage.\n:\n***Spellcasting.*** This Creature casts one of the following Arts, using Wisdom as its Spellcasting Ability (Spell Save DC 12):\n\n*At Will:* Armour of Agathys, Rime's Binding Ice\n\n### Bonus Actions\n***Snowpriest (Recharge 5+):*** This Creature casts an \"At Will\" Art that has a cost of Action as a Bonus Action."
