    "content": "<h2>Heavy Soldier</h2>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><em>Medium Humanoid (any race), Chaotic Good</em><br>___<br><strong>Armor Class</strong> :: 12 (Combat Gear + Combat Shield)<br><strong>Hit Points</strong>  :: 13 (2d8+4)<br><strong>Speed</strong>       :: 30ft.<br>___</p>\n<div class=\"ak5e-source-table-wrap\"><table class=\"ak5e-source-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">STR</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">DEX</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CON</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">INT</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">WIS</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CHA</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">12 (+1)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10 (0)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">14 (+2)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10 (0)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">12 (+1)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10 (0)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">___<br><strong>Senses</strong>               :: passive Perception 11<br><strong>Languages</strong>            :: Speaks two languages<br><strong>Challenge</strong>            :: 1/4 (50 XP) <strong>Proficiency Bonus</strong> +2<br>---<br><strong><em>Damage Reduction.</em></strong> This Creature has 5 Damage Reduction against Physical Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Reunion.</em></strong> This Creature is Immune to the Frightened Condition if there is another Creature with this Ability within 10 feet.</p>\n<h3>Actions</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Salvaged Weapon.</em></strong> <em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +3 to hit, reach 5ft., one target, <em>Hit:</em> 5 (1d6+1) Slashing Damage.</p>\n<h3>Reactions</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Defend.</em></strong> <em>Trigger:</em> An allied Creature within 5 feet is targeted for an Attack. <em>Response:</em> This Creature becomes the target instead.</p>",
    "rawSource": "## Heavy Soldier\n*Medium Humanoid (any race), Chaotic Good*\n___\n**Armor Class** :: 12 (Combat Gear + Combat Shield)\n**Hit Points**  :: 13 (2d8+4) \n**Speed**       :: 30ft.\n___\n|  STR  |  DEX  |  CON  |  INT  |  WIS  |  CHA  |\n|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|\n|12 (+1)|10 (0) |14 (+2)|10 (0) |12 (+1)|10 (0) |\n___\n**Senses**               :: passive Perception 11\n**Languages**            :: Speaks two languages\n**Challenge**            :: 1/4 (50 XP) {{bonus **Proficiency Bonus** +2}}\n---\n***Damage Reduction.*** This Creature has 5 Damage Reduction against Physical Damage.\n:\n***Reunion.*** This Creature is Immune to the Frightened Condition if there is another Creature with this Ability within 10 feet.\n\n### Actions\n***Salvaged Weapon.*** *Melee Weapon Attack:* +3 to hit, reach 5ft., one target, *Hit:* 5 (1d6+1) Slashing Damage.\n\n\n### Reactions\n***Defend.*** *Trigger:* An allied Creature within 5 feet is targeted for an Attack. *Response:* This Creature becomes the target instead."
