    "rawSource": "## Guerilla Signaller\n*Medium Humanoid (any race), Chaotic Good*\n___\n**Armor Class** :: 12 (Combat Gear)\n**Hit Points**  :: 27 \n**Speed**       :: 30ft.\n___\n|  STR  |  DEX  |  CON  |  INT  |  WIS  |  CHA  |\n|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|\n|14 (+2)|10 (0) |12 (+1)|10 (0) |14 (+2)|12 (+1)|\n___\n**Senses**               :: passive Perception 12\n**Languages**            :: Speaks two languages\n**Challenge**            :: 1 (200 XP) {{bonus **Proficiency Bonus** +2}}\n---\n***Damage Reduction.*** This Creature has 3 Damage Reduction against Physical Damage.\n:\n***Reunion.*** This Creature is Immune to the Frightened Condition if there is another Creature with this Ability within 10 feet.\n\n### Actions\n***Inspire and Coordinate.*** Until the beginning of this Creature's next Turn, all Creatures within 50 feet that have the Shieldguard Ability, and that can hear this Creature, become Inspired and gain the benefits directed by that Feature.\n:\n***Longspear.*** *Melee Weapon Attack:* +3 to hit, reach 10ft., one target, *Hit:* 8 (1d10+2) Piercing Damage."
