        "section": "Bonus Actions",
        "content": "<h5>On Wings of Fire (3/day)</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">This Creature chooses a location within 100 feet and flies upwards, before landing at that location; there can be no roofs on this flight path. When it lands, all other Creatures within 10 feet must make a DC15 Dexterity Saving Throw, taking 14 (4d6) Fire Damage on a failed Save, or half as much (7) on a successful Save.</p>",
