    "content": "<h2>Guerilla Siegebreaker</h2>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><em>Medium Humanoid (any race), Chaotic Good</em><br>___<br><strong>Armor Class</strong> :: 12 (Combat Gear + Combat Shield)<br><strong>Hit Points</strong>  :: 130 (20d8+40)<br><strong>Speed</strong>       :: 30ft.<br>___</p>\n<div class=\"ak5e-source-table-wrap\"><table class=\"ak5e-source-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">STR</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">DEX</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CON</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">INT</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">WIS</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CHA</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">18 (+4)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10 (0)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">14 (+2)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10 (0)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">16 (+3)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10 (0)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">___<br><strong>Skills</strong>               :: Athletics +7, Intimidation +3<br><strong>Saving Throws</strong>        :: Strength +7, Wisdom +6<br><strong>Senses</strong>               :: passive Perception 13<br><strong>Languages</strong>            :: Speaks Ursine + one other Language<br><strong>Challenge</strong>            :: 5 (1800 XP) <strong>Proficiency Bonus</strong> +3<br>---<br><strong><em>Damage Reduction.</em></strong> This Creature has 5 DR against Physical Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Reunion.</em></strong> This Creature is Immune to the Frightened Condition if there is another Creature with this Ability within 10 feet.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Shieldguard.</em></strong> While this Creature is Inspired by another Shieldguard or Patriot, it deals an additional die of Damage with its Attacks.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Truly Deadly.</em></strong> The first time each Turn this Creature hits with a Melee Attack, that Attack deals additional Damage equal to twice this Creature’s Proficiency Bonus (6)</p>\n<h3>Actions</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Multiattack.</em></strong> This Creature makes two Melee Attacks.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Axe.</em></strong> <em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +7 to hit, reach 5ft., one target, <em>Hit:</em> 9 (2d4+4) Slashing Damage.</p>\n<h3>Bonus Actions</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>On Wings of Fire (3/day).</em></strong> This Creature chooses a location within 100 feet and flies upwards, before landing at that location; there can be no roofs on this flight path. When it lands, all other Creatures within 10 feet must make a DC15 Dexterity Saving Throw, taking 14 (4d6) Fire Damage on a failed Save, or half as much (7) on a successful Save.</p>",
    "rawSource": "## Guerilla Siegebreaker\n*Medium Humanoid (any race), Chaotic Good*\n___\n**Armor Class** :: 12 (Combat Gear + Combat Shield)\n**Hit Points**  :: 130 (20d8+40) \n**Speed**       :: 30ft.\n___\n|  STR  |  DEX  |  CON  |  INT  |  WIS  |  CHA  |\n|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|\n|18 (+4)|10 (0) |14 (+2)|10 (0) |16 (+3)|10 (0) |\n___\n**Skills**               :: Athletics +7, Intimidation +3\n**Saving Throws**        :: Strength +7, Wisdom +6 \n**Senses**               :: passive Perception 13\n**Languages**            :: Speaks Ursine + one other Language\n**Challenge**            :: 5 (1800 XP) {{bonus **Proficiency Bonus** +3}}\n---\n***Damage Reduction.*** This Creature has 5 DR against Physical Damage.\n:\n***Reunion.*** This Creature is Immune to the Frightened Condition if there is another Creature with this Ability within 10 feet.\n:\n***Shieldguard.*** While this Creature is Inspired by another Shieldguard or Patriot, it deals an additional die of Damage with its Attacks.\n:\n***Truly Deadly.*** The first time each Turn this Creature hits with a Melee Attack, that Attack deals additional Damage equal to twice this Creature’s Proficiency Bonus (6)\n\n\\column\n\n### Actions\n***Multiattack.*** This Creature makes two Melee Attacks.\n:\n***Axe.*** *Melee Weapon Attack:* +7 to hit, reach 5ft., one target, *Hit:* 9 (2d4+4) Slashing Damage.\n\n### Bonus Actions\n***On Wings of Fire (3/day).*** This Creature chooses a location within 100 feet and flies upwards, before landing at that location; there can be no roofs on this flight path. When it lands, all other Creatures within 10 feet must make a DC15 Dexterity Saving Throw, taking 14 (4d6) Fire Damage on a failed Save, or half as much (7) on a successful Save."
