        "section": "Traits",
        "content": "<h5>Automated Defences</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">This Creature has an additional Reaction that can only be used to use its Rotate Shields Reaction. It regains use of this Reaction at the beginning of its Turn.</p>",
