        "section": "Actions",
        "content": "<h5>Raise the Herd (Art) (Recharge 5+)</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Mephisto chooses two Creatures they can see within 60 feet who fulfil the following conditions: not Undead, have died within the last hour, and had Oripathy.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Those Creatures are returned to life with half of their maximum Hit Points. Their Creature Type becomes Undead, their Intelligence and Charisma Scores are reduced to 4, and they become Immune to the Frightened and Charmed Condition. Additionally, at the beginning of each of their Turns. they regain 1d8 Hit Points. However, these Creatures cannot cast Arts, use any Ability labelled as (Art), or make Ranged Attacks.</p>",
