        "content": "<h5>(Marching Stance only) Patriot's Halberd</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +12 to hit, reach 10ft., one target, <em>Hit:</em> 23 (3d10+6) Slashing Damage.</p>",
        "rawSource": "*Melee Weapon Attack:* +12 to hit, reach 10ft., one target, *Hit:* 23 (3d10+6) Slashing Damage.\n"
