    "content": "<h2>Heirbearer Warrior</h2>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><em>Medium Fiend (Humanoid), Neutral</em><br>___<br><strong>Armor Class</strong> :: 12 (Combat Gear)<br><strong>Hit Points</strong>  :: 19 (3d8+6)<br><strong>Speed</strong>       :: 30ft.<br>___</p>\n<div class=\"ak5e-source-table-wrap\"><table class=\"ak5e-source-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">STR</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">DEX</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CON</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">INT</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">WIS</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CHA</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">12 (+1)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10 (0)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">14 (+2)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10 (0)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">12 (+1)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10 (0)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">___<br><strong>Skills</strong>               :: Athletics +6<br><strong>Senses</strong>               :: passive Perception 11<br><strong>Languages</strong>            :: Speaks Sarkazian and one other language<br><strong>Challenge</strong>            :: 1 (200 XP) <strong>Proficiency Bonus</strong> +2<br>---<br><strong><em>Blood's Blessing.</em></strong> This Creature regains 1d6 missing Hit Points at the beginning of each of its Turns.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Damage Reduction.</em></strong> This Creature has 3 DR against Physical Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Touch of The Sanguinarch.</em></strong> When this Creature would be killed in a way that would not destroy their body, they do not immediately die. Instead, they die at the end of their next Turn; during this time, they are immune to all Conditions and effects that would not destroy their body.</p>\n<h3>Actions</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Greatsword.</em></strong> <em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +4 to hit, reach 5ft., one target, <em>Hit:</em> 10 (2d8+1) Slashing Damage</p>",
    "rawSource": "## Heirbearer Warrior\n*Medium Fiend (Humanoid), Neutral*\n___\n**Armor Class** :: 12 (Combat Gear)\n**Hit Points**  :: 19 (3d8+6)\n**Speed**       :: 30ft.\n___\n|  STR  |  DEX  |  CON  |  INT  |  WIS  |  CHA  |\n|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|\n|12 (+1)|10 (0) |14 (+2)|10 (0) |12 (+1)|10 (0) |\n___\n**Skills**               :: Athletics +6\n**Senses**               :: passive Perception 11\n**Languages**            :: Speaks Sarkazian and one other language\n**Challenge**            :: 1 (200 XP) {{bonus **Proficiency Bonus** +2}}\n---\n***Blood's Blessing.*** This Creature regains 1d6 missing Hit Points at the beginning of each of its Turns.\n:\n***Damage Reduction.*** This Creature has 3 DR against Physical Damage.\n:\n***Touch of The Sanguinarch.*** When this Creature would be killed in a way that would not destroy their body, they do not immediately die. Instead, they die at the end of their next Turn; during this time, they are immune to all Conditions and effects that would not destroy their body.\n\n### Actions\n***Greatsword.*** *Melee Weapon Attack:* +4 to hit, reach 5ft., one target, *Hit:* 10 (2d8+1) Slashing Damage"
