    "rawSource": "## Goliath Arbalest\n*Large Fiend (Humanoid), Neutral*\n___\n**Armor Class** :: 12 (Underarmour)\n**Hit Points**  :: 82 (11d10+22)\n**Speed**       :: 25ft.\n___\n|  STR  |  DEX  |  CON  |  INT  |  WIS  |  CHA  |\n|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|\n|18 (+4)|12 (+1)|14 (+2)|10 (0) |16 (+3)|10 (0) |\n___\n**Saving Throws**        :: Strength +6\n**Skills**               :: Athletics +6, Perception +5, Intimidation +4\n**Senses**               :: passive Perception 15\n**Languages**            :: Speaks Sarkazian and one other language\n**Challenge**            :: 3 (700 XP) {{bonus **Proficiency Bonus** +2}}\n---\n***Cling to the World (1/day).*** When this Creature would be reduced to 0 Hit Points but not killed outright, it is instead reduced to 1 Hit Point.\n:\n***Hulking Strength.*** This Creature can use its Strength Modifier instead of Dexterity for Attack and Damage Rolls using Ranged Weapons. Additionally, they ignore the Loading Property of Heavy Crossbows.\n:\n***Damage Reduction.*** This Creature has 2 DR against Physical Damage.\n\n### Actions\n***Multiattack.*** This Creature makes two Attacks.\n:\n***Heavy Crossbow.*** *Ranged Weapon Attack:* +6 to hit, range 100/400 ft., one target, *Hit:* 15 (1d10+4) Piercing Damage.\n:\n***Goliath Cleaver.*** *Melee Weapon Attack:* +6 to hit, reach 5ft., one target, *Hit:* 9 (1d8+4) Slashing Damage"
