        "section": "Bonus Actions",
        "content": "<h5>Empower Weapon (Art) (1/day)</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">This Creature empowers a melee weapon they are wielding with their Arts. For the next ten minutes, that weapon deals 5 (1d8) additional Necrotic Damage on hit.</p>",
        "rawSource": "This Creature empowers a melee weapon they are wielding with their Arts. For the next ten minutes, that weapon deals 5 (1d8) additional Necrotic Damage on hit."
