        "content": "<h5>Brandish (Art) (Recharge 5+)</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Theresis releases a blast of Arts from his Sword in a 100-foot-long, 10-feet-wide line originating from him. All Creatures caught in the line must make a DC 18 Dexterity Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they take 29 (6d8) Force Damage; on a successful Save, they take half as much (14) Damage. Brandish deals 9 (2d8) additional Damage for every Shadow of the Lord within 120 feet of Theresis when he uses it.</p>",
