        "section": "Reactions",
        "content": "<h5>Shadow-walker</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><em>Trigger:</em> Theresis is hit by an Attack, or is forced to make a Saving Throw against an effect he can see while there is a \"Shadow of the Lord\" within 60 feet of him. <em>Response:</em> Theresis swaps places with a \"Shadow of the Lord\" of his choice within 60 feet. If the triggering instance was an Attack, that Attack instead hits that \"Shadow of the Lord\". If the triggering instance was a Saving Throw, Theresis automatically succeeds on the Saving Throw if he has left the affected area; he takes no Damage and suffers no effects, but that \"Shadow of the Lord\" is treated as a new affected Creature.</p>",
