        "section": "Traits",
        "content": "<h5>Blooddrinker</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Duq'arael regains 11 (2d10) Hit Points at the beginning of his Turn. If he has dealt Damage to a Creature with Bite during his last Turn, this amount is doubled.</p>",
