        "section": "Traits",
        "content": "<h5>Moving Colony</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When this Creature dies, it spreads Nethersea Brand onto all non-living surfaces within 20 feet of it. Additionally, the area within 10 feet of this Creature is considered to be Nethersea Brand for anything that requires it.</p>",
