    "content": "<h2>Nethersea Swarmcaller</h2>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><em>Large Aberration, Unaligned</em><br>___<br><strong>Armor Class</strong> :: 10 (Natural Armour)<br><strong>Hit Points</strong>  :: 142 (19d10+38)<br><strong>Speed</strong>       :: 20 ft, swim 20ft.<br>___</p>\n<div class=\"ak5e-source-table-wrap\"><table class=\"ak5e-source-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">STR</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">DEX</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CON</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">INT</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">WIS</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CHA</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10 (0)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6 (-2)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">14 (+2)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10 (0)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">18 (+4)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">14 (+2)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">___<br><strong>Saving Throws</strong>        :: Constitution +4, Wisdom +6, Charisma +4<br><strong>Skills</strong>               :: Perception +8<br><strong>Condition Immunities</strong> :: Charmed<br><strong>Senses</strong>               :: passive Perception 18, Blindsight 100 ft<br><strong>Languages</strong>            :: Understands spoken language but cannot speak<br><strong>Challenge</strong>            :: 7 (2900 XP) <strong>Proficiency Bonus</strong> +2<br>---<br><strong><em>Host of The Swarm.</em></strong> This Creature continually projects dangerous micro-organisms in a 20-foot-radius sphere that follows its movement. When this sphere enters a non-Seaborn Creature’s space, a non-Seaborn Creature enters the area during its Turn, or a non-Seaborn Creature ends its Turn in the area, that Creature must make a DC12 Constitution Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they take 14 (4d6) Necrotic Damage. On a successful Save, they take half as much (7) Damage. This Feature does not start active; this Creature must expend an Action to activate it. Additionally, this ability is disabled while this Creature is Silenced.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Living Brand.</em></strong> This Creature immediately becomes aware of the presence, but not identity, of any Creature that moves within a 30-foot radius of it.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>We Many.</em></strong> This Creature does not need to breathe, is Immune to the Charmed Condition (included in their Condition Immunities), and has Advantage on Charisma Saving Throws. Additionally, they are aware of what other Seaborn within 1 mile can see and hear.</p>\n<h3>Actions</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Activate Swarm Aura.</em></strong> This Creature disables or enables its Host of the Swarm Trait.</p>",
    "rawSource": "## Nethersea Swarmcaller\n*Large Aberration, Unaligned*\n___\n**Armor Class** :: 10 (Natural Armour)\n**Hit Points**  :: 142 (19d10+38)\n**Speed**       :: 20 ft, swim 20ft.\n___\n|  STR  |  DEX  |  CON  |  INT  |  WIS  |  CHA  |\n|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|\n|10 (0) |6 (-2) |14 (+2)|10 (0) |18 (+4)|14 (+2)|\n___\n**Saving Throws**        :: Constitution +4, Wisdom +6, Charisma +4\n**Skills**               :: Perception +8\n**Condition Immunities** :: Charmed\n**Senses**               :: passive Perception 18, Blindsight 100 ft\n**Languages**            :: Understands spoken language but cannot speak\n**Challenge**            :: 7 (2900 XP) {{bonus **Proficiency Bonus** +2}}\n---\n***Host of The Swarm.*** This Creature continually projects dangerous micro-organisms in a 20-foot-radius sphere that follows its movement. When this sphere enters a non-Seaborn Creature’s space, a non-Seaborn Creature enters the area during its Turn, or a non-Seaborn Creature ends its Turn in the area, that Creature must make a DC12 Constitution Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they take 14 (4d6) Necrotic Damage. On a successful Save, they take half as much (7) Damage. This Feature does not start active; this Creature must expend an Action to activate it. Additionally, this ability is disabled while this Creature is Silenced.\n:\n***Living Brand.*** This Creature immediately becomes aware of the presence, but not identity, of any Creature that moves within a 30-foot radius of it.\n:\n***We Many.*** This Creature does not need to breathe, is Immune to the Charmed Condition (included in their Condition Immunities), and has Advantage on Charisma Saving Throws. Additionally, they are aware of what other Seaborn within 1 mile can see and hear.\n\n### Actions\n***Activate Swarm Aura.*** This Creature disables or enables its Host of the Swarm Trait."
