        "section": "Traits",
        "content": "<h5>Escaping Impurities</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">Each time this Creature takes Damage, roll 1d6; on a 4+, all non-Seaborn Creatures within a 15-foot-radius of this Creature must make a DC13 Constitution Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they take 14 (4d6) Poison Damage, and have Nervous Impairment until the end of their next Turn. On a successful Save, they take half as much (7) Damage, and suffer no other effects.</p>",
        "rawSource": "Each time this Creature takes Damage, roll 1d6; on a 4+, all non-Seaborn Creatures within a 15-foot-radius of this Creature must make a DC13 Constitution Saving Throw. On a failed Save, they take 14 (4d6) Poison Damage, and have Nervous Impairment until the end of their next Turn. On a successful Save, they take half as much (7) Damage, and suffer no other effects.\n"
