        "section": "Bonus Action",
        "content": "<h5>Shine the Lantern</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">The Brandguider shines its Lantern on a Creature it can see within 60 feet; until the beginning of this Creature's next Turn, other Creatures have Advantage on Attack Rolls against that Creature.</p>",
