        "content": "<h5>Tidelink</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">When this Creature dies but is not destroyed while another Creature with this Ability is present within 300 feet, keep tracking this Creature's Turns. At the end of the third of its Turns after dying, if the other Creatures with this Ability are not also dead, this Creature is restored to life and its maximum Hit Points.</p>",
