    "rawSource": "## \"Anvil\"\n*Small Construct (Drone), Unaligned*\n___\n**Armor Class** :: 14 (Natural)\n**Hit Points**  :: 5 (2d6-2)\n**Speed**       :: hover 30 ft.\n___\n|  STR  |  DEX  |  CON  |  INT  |  WIS  |  CHA  |\n|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|\n|2 (-4) |10 (0) |8 (-1) |1  (-5)|1  (-5)|1  (-5)|\n___\n**Damage Immunities**    :: Poison, Necrotic\n**Condition Immunities** :: Charmed, Frightened, Poisoned, Necrotised, Nervous Impairment\n**Senses**               :: passive Perception 5\n**Languages**            :: -\n**Challenge**            :: 1/8 (25 XP) {{bonus **Proficiency Bonus** +2}}\n---\n\n***Disposable Construct.*** The Hit Points of this Unit cannot be restored.\n\n### Actions\n***Medical Aid (once only).*** All non-Construct Creatures within 10 feet of this Creature recover 5 (2d4) Hit Points, gaining any excess as Temporary Hit Points."
