    "content": "<h2>Anti-Armour Infantry</h2>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><em>Medium Humanoid (any race), Lawful Neutral</em><br>___<br><strong>Armor Class</strong> :: 14 (Combat Gear)<br><strong>Hit Points</strong>  :: 16 (3d8+3)<br><strong>Speed</strong>       :: 30 ft.<br>___</p>\n<div class=\"ak5e-source-table-wrap\"><table class=\"ak5e-source-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">STR</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">DEX</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CON</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">INT</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">WIS</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CHA</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">14 (+2)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">14 (+2)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">12 (+1)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10 (0)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">14 (+2)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10 (0)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">___<br><strong>Skills</strong>               :: Athletics +4<br><strong>Senses</strong>               :: passive Perception 12<br><strong>Languages</strong>            :: Speaks two languages<br><strong>Challenge</strong>            :: 1 (200 XP) <strong>Proficiency Bonus</strong> +2<br>---<br><strong><em>Damage Reduction.</em></strong> This Creature has 3 DR against all Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Professional Anti-Arts Training.</em></strong> This Creature always has DR against Arts Damage equal to its DR against Physical Damage (included it its Damage Reduction Ability).</p>\n<h3>Actions</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Disposable Anti-Armour Missile Launcher (once only).</em></strong> <em>Ranged Weapon Attack:</em> +4 to hit, range 75/150 ft., one target. <em>Hit:</em> 16 (2d8+2) Thunder Damage plus 9 (2d8) Thunder Damage if that Creature has any Damage Reduction against Physical Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Sword.</em></strong> <em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +4 to hit, reach 5ft., one target. <em>Hit:</em> 7 (1d8+2) Slashing Damage.</p>\n<h3>Bonus Actions</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Take Aim.</em></strong> Can only be used if this Creature has not moved this Turn. This Creature’s Speed is reduced to 0 until the end of the Turn. However, the next Ranged Attack it makes during this Turn is made with Advantage.</p>",
    "rawSource": "## Anti-Armour Infantry\n*Medium Humanoid (any race), Lawful Neutral*\n___\n**Armor Class** :: 14 (Combat Gear)\n**Hit Points**  :: 16 (3d8+3)\n**Speed**       :: 30 ft.\n___\n|  STR  |  DEX  |  CON  |  INT  |  WIS  |  CHA  |\n|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|\n|14 (+2)|14 (+2)|12 (+1)|10 (0) |14 (+2)|10 (0) |\n___\n**Skills**               :: Athletics +4\n**Senses**               :: passive Perception 12\n**Languages**            :: Speaks two languages\n**Challenge**            :: 1 (200 XP) {{bonus **Proficiency Bonus** +2}}\n---\n***Damage Reduction.*** This Creature has 3 DR against all Damage.\n:\n***Professional Anti-Arts Training.*** This Creature always has DR against Arts Damage equal to its DR against Physical Damage (included it its Damage Reduction Ability).\n\n### Actions\n***Disposable Anti-Armour Missile Launcher (once only).*** *Ranged Weapon Attack:* +4 to hit, range 75/150 ft., one target. *Hit:* 16 (2d8+2) Thunder Damage plus 9 (2d8) Thunder Damage if that Creature has any Damage Reduction against Physical Damage.\n:\n***Sword.*** *Melee Weapon Attack:* +4 to hit, reach 5ft., one target. *Hit:* 7 (1d8+2) Slashing Damage.\n\n### Bonus Actions\n***Take Aim.*** Can only be used if this Creature has not moved this Turn. This Creature’s Speed is reduced to 0 until the end of the Turn. However, the next Ranged Attack it makes during this Turn is made with Advantage."
