    "continuationCount": 0,
    "content": "<h2>Ursus Mangler</h2>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><em>Large Beast, Unaligned</em><br>___<br><strong>Armor Class</strong> :: 11 (Metal Armour)<br><strong>Hit Points</strong>  :: 25 (3d10+6)<br><strong>Speed</strong>       :: 30 ft., climb 20 ft.<br>___</p>\n<div class=\"ak5e-source-table-wrap\"><table class=\"ak5e-source-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">STR</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">DEX</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CON</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">INT</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">WIS</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CHA</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">15 (+2)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10 (0)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">14 (+2)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">4 (-3)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">13 (+1)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">6  (-2)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">___<br><strong>Skills</strong>               :: Athletics +6<br><strong>Senses</strong>               :: passive Perception 11<br><strong>Languages</strong>            :: -<br><strong>Challenge</strong>            :: 2 (450 XP) <strong>Proficiency Bonus</strong> +2<br>---</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Damage Reduction.</em></strong> This Creature has 3 DR against Physical Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Damned Juggernaut.</em></strong> This Creature deals an additional die of Damage to Creatures that have the Frightened Condition or Creatures who are not wielding a Weapon.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Keen Smell.</em></strong> This Creature has Advantage on Wisdom (Perception) checks that rely on smell.</p>\n<h3>Actions</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Multiattack.</em></strong> This Creature makes two Attacks.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Maul.</em></strong> <em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +4 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. <em>Hit:</em> 6 (1d6+2) Slashing Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong>Terrifying Roar (1/day)</strong> All Creatures within a 50-foot cone originating from this Creature and who can hear it must succeed on a DC 14 Wisdom Saving Throw or become Frightened of this Creature.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">A Creature may reattempt the Saving Throw at the end of each of its Turns, ending the effect on a success.</p>\n<h3>Bonus Actions</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Aggressive.</em></strong> The Creature moves up to its Speed towards a hostile Creature it can see.</p>",
    "rawSource": "## Ursus Mangler\n*Large Beast, Unaligned*\n___\n**Armor Class** :: 11 (Metal Armour)\n**Hit Points**  :: 25 (3d10+6) \n**Speed**       :: 30 ft., climb 20 ft.\n___\n|  STR  |  DEX  |  CON  |  INT  |  WIS  |  CHA  |\n|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|\n|15 (+2)|10 (0) |14 (+2)|4 (-3) |13 (+1)|6  (-2)|\n___\n**Skills**               :: Athletics +6\n**Senses**               :: passive Perception 11\n**Languages**            :: -\n**Challenge**            :: 2 (450 XP) {{bonus **Proficiency Bonus** +2}}\n---\n\n***Damage Reduction.*** This Creature has 3 DR against Physical Damage.\n:\n***Damned Juggernaut.*** This Creature deals an additional die of Damage to Creatures that have the Frightened Condition or Creatures who are not wielding a Weapon.\n:\n***Keen Smell.*** This Creature has Advantage on Wisdom (Perception) checks that rely on smell.\n\n### Actions\n***Multiattack.*** This Creature makes two Attacks.\n:\n***Maul.*** *Melee Weapon Attack:* +4 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. *Hit:* 6 (1d6+2) Slashing Damage.\n:\n**Terrifying Roar (1/day)** All Creatures within a 50-foot cone originating from this Creature and who can hear it must succeed on a DC 14 Wisdom Saving Throw or become Frightened of this Creature.\n:\nA Creature may reattempt the Saving Throw at the end of each of its Turns, ending the effect on a success.\n\n### Bonus Actions\n***Aggressive.*** The Creature moves up to its Speed towards a hostile Creature it can see."
