    "continuationCount": 0,
    "content": "<h2>Ursus Raider</h2>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><em>Medium Humanoid (Ursi), Lawful Neutral</em><br>___<br><strong>Armor Class</strong> :: 14 (Heavy Combat Gear)<br><strong>Hit Points</strong>  :: 49 (9d8+9)<br><strong>Speed</strong>       :: 30ft.<br>___</p>\n<div class=\"ak5e-source-table-wrap\"><table class=\"ak5e-source-table\"><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">STR</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">DEX</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CON</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">INT</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">WIS</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">CHA</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">14 (+2)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">12 (+1)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">12 (+1)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10 (0)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">12 (+1)</td><td class=\"ak5e-source-table__center\">10 (0)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">___<br><strong>Saving Throws</strong>        :: Strength +7, Dexterity +4<br><strong>Skills</strong>               :: Athletics +6, Acrobatics +4<br><strong>Senses</strong>               :: passive Perception 12<br><strong>Languages</strong>            :: Speaks Ursine + one other language<br><strong>Challenge</strong>            :: 2 (450 XP) <strong>Proficiency Bonus</strong> +3<br>---<br><strong><em>Charger.</em></strong> If this Creature has moved at least 20 feet in a straight line immediately before hitting with a Melee Attack, it chooses one of the following effects: That Attack deals 6 (1d10) additional Slashing Damage, or the target Creature is pushed 10 feet away if they are no more than one size larger than this Creature.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Damage Reduction.</em></strong> This Creature has 4 DR against Physical Damage.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Damned Juggernaut.</em></strong> This Creature deals an additional die of Damage to Creatures that have the Frightened Condition or Creatures who are not wielding a Weapon.</p>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Hit and Run.</em></strong> This Creature does not incur Opportunity Attacks from Creatures it has Attacked during that Turn.</p>\n<h3>Actions</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Bardiche.</em></strong> <em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +4 to hit, reach 10ft., one target, <em>Hit:</em> 8 (1d10+2) Slashing Damage.</p>\n<h3>Bonus Actions</h3>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\"><strong><em>Aggressive.</em></strong> The Creature moves up to its Speed towards a hostile Creature it can see.</p>",
    "rawSource": "## Ursus Raider\n*Medium Humanoid (Ursi), Lawful Neutral*\n___\n**Armor Class** :: 14 (Heavy Combat Gear)\n**Hit Points**  :: 49 (9d8+9)\n**Speed**       :: 30ft.\n___\n|  STR  |  DEX  |  CON  |  INT  |  WIS  |  CHA  |\n|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|\n|14 (+2)|12 (+1)|12 (+1)|10 (0) |12 (+1)|10 (0) |\n___\n**Saving Throws**        :: Strength +7, Dexterity +4\n**Skills**               :: Athletics +6, Acrobatics +4\n**Senses**               :: passive Perception 12\n**Languages**            :: Speaks Ursine + one other language\n**Challenge**            :: 2 (450 XP) {{bonus **Proficiency Bonus** +3}}\n---\n***Charger.*** If this Creature has moved at least 20 feet in a straight line immediately before hitting with a Melee Attack, it chooses one of the following effects: That Attack deals 6 (1d10) additional Slashing Damage, or the target Creature is pushed 10 feet away if they are no more than one size larger than this Creature.\n:\n***Damage Reduction.*** This Creature has 4 DR against Physical Damage.\n:\n***Damned Juggernaut.*** This Creature deals an additional die of Damage to Creatures that have the Frightened Condition or Creatures who are not wielding a Weapon.\n:\n***Hit and Run.*** This Creature does not incur Opportunity Attacks from Creatures it has Attacked during that Turn.\n\n### Actions\n***Bardiche.*** *Melee Weapon Attack:* +4 to hit, reach 10ft., one target, *Hit:* 8 (1d10+2) Slashing Damage.\n\n### Bonus Actions\n***Aggressive.*** The Creature moves up to its Speed towards a hostile Creature it can see."
