        "section": "Traits",
        "content": "<h5>Portable</h5>\n<p class=\"ak5e-source-paragraph\">As an Action, an allied Creature within 5 feet of the Turret can fold it into a portable form; while it is in this Portable form, it is considered to be Unconscious. While in portable form, the Turret weighs 10 lbs, and is small enough to be carried under one arm. A Creature carrying the Turret can unfold it as a Bonus Action, deploying it to an unoccupied space within 5 feet of them.</p>",
