    "rawSource": "## Lateran Executor (Machine Gun)\n*Elite Medium Celestial (Humanoid), Lawful Neutral*\n___\n**Armor Class** :: 18 (Vanguard Armour) \n**Hit Points**  :: 110 (17d8+34)\n**Speed**       :: 30 ft.\n___\n|  STR  |  DEX  |  CON  |  INT  |  WIS  |  CHA  |\n|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|:-----:|\n|12 (+1)|18 (+4)|14 (+2)|16 (+3)|16 (+3)|10 (+0)|\n___\n**Skills**               :: Athletics +4, Investigation +6, Perception +6\n**Senses**               :: Passive Perception 16\n**Languages**            :: Speaks Lateran, Victorian, and two other languages.\n**Challenge**            :: 5 (1800 XP) {{bonus **Proficiency Bonus** +3}}\n___\n***Empathy.*** As Sankta, the Executors have access to the Sankta Species' \"Empathy\" Feature.\n\n### Actions\n***Multiattack.*** This Creature makes two Attacks.\n:\n***Knife.*** *Melee Weapon Attack:* +7 to hit, Reach 5 ft., one target. *Hit* 8 (1d6 + 4) Piercing Damage.\n:\n***Grenade (2/day).*** The Executor throws a grenade at a location they can see within 30 feet; all Creatures within a 10-foot-radius sphere centered on that point must make a DC15 Dexterity Saving Throw, taking 4d8 Thunder Damage on a failed Save, or half as much on a successful Save.\n:\n***Patron Machine Gun.*** *Ranged Weapon Attack:* +7 to hit, Range 75/200 ft., one target. *Hit* 11 (2d6 + 4) Piercing Damage.\n\n### Bonus Actions\n\n***Rapid Fire.*** *Ranged Weapon Attack:* +7 to hit, Range 75/200 ft., one target. *Hit* 11 (2d6+4) Piercing Damage."
